Package: claude-termux
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: aarch64
Maintainer: Robert Wallner <robert.wallner.edward@gmail.com>
Depends: glibc-runner
Description: Claude Code (glibc build) patched to run natively under Termux
 Ships the patched linux-arm64 glibc build of Claude Code and the
 Termux wrapper that clears LD_PRELOAD before exec'ing it.
